# Block palette for the blocks-terrain example.
# One flat material per block type - no textures on purpose: a block
# world is thousands of merged faces, and a flat Kd costs nothing in
# GS VRAM while a texture would be resident forever.

newmtl grass
Kd 0.360 0.620 0.240
Ka 0 0 0
Ks 0 0 0

newmtl dirt
Kd 0.450 0.320 0.200
Ka 0 0 0
Ks 0 0 0

newmtl stone
Kd 0.480 0.480 0.500
Ka 0 0 0
Ks 0 0 0

newmtl sand
Kd 0.800 0.720 0.450
Ka 0 0 0
Ks 0 0 0

newmtl snow
Kd 0.900 0.920 0.950
Ka 0 0 0
Ks 0 0 0
